    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Use your creativity and imagination to solve charming physics puzzles by drawing a single shape and watching what unfolds! Complete the objectives of 250 puzzles (with more on the way), each with multiple and often surprising solutions. How you draw your solution is up to you!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solve puzzles and earn rewards to build your very own Squiggletown! Unlock buildings, cosmetics and various upgrades as you expand your own personal city.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Squiggle Drop Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 250 levels<br></li><li>Regular Content Updates<br></li><li>Daily Challenges<br></li><li>Challenging your friends to beat your scores<br></li><li>Leaderboards and Achievements</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/a2d8f151a62aafca48fc0bc7f6910a68.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Use your creativity and imagination to solve charming physics puzzles by drawing a single shape and watching what unfolds! Complete the objectives of 250 puzzles (with more on the way), each with multiple and often surprising solutions. How you draw your solution is up to you!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/c20d21c7fb9edc63eb40e086db08c6fc.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solve puzzles and earn rewards to build your very own Squiggletown! Unlock buildings, cosmetics and various upgrades as you expand your own personal city.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.poster.avif?t=1728056929\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.webm?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838400/extras/3df1d85ba58fdc461b7963f7ec87e7de.mp4?t=1728056929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Squiggle Drop Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 250 levels<br></li><li>Regular Content Updates<br></li><li>Daily Challenges<br></li><li>Challenging your friends to beat your scores<br></li><li>Leaderboards and Achievements</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Draw shapes to solve physics puzzles! Over 250 levels each with their own unique objective. Put your brain to the test by making bridges, levers, weights and more. Iterate on your solutions again and again until you complete the goals.",
